# StreamFit API credentials
STREAMFIT_EMAIL=your@email.com
STREAMFIT_PIN=your_pin

# CrossFit 514 channel ID
STREAMFIT_CHANNEL_ID=812

# Auth flow notes (2026):
# - The old /new/auth/sign_in PIN API is dead ("Update your app").
# - Login now runs via headless Chromium (src/browser_login.py): email -> PIN
#   -> MFA code (auto-read from Gmail via the gws CLI).
# - Devise tokens (access-token/client/uid/expiry) are saved to .tokens.json
#   (gitignored) and reused until they expire. Env vars below OVERRIDE the file.
# STREAMFIT_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# STREAMFIT_CLIENT=
# STREAMFIT_EXPIRY=
# STREAMFIT_UID=
